{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life of an NPC is a top-down AI-directed town simulator. Each NPC formulates their own goals and decides how to respond to other NPCs or in-game events. They can also use items on each other or interact with objects within the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towns are procedurally generated via your prompt. Manipulate a character's goals or add new objects into the world to see how they react and develop over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently in Early Access. Please see the &quot;Early Access&quot; section for details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notice</strong>: The future of this game is uncertain and continued updates are not guaranteed, though I will do my best to ensure it isn\u2019t broken. Among AI Roguelite, AI Roguelite 2D, and Life of an NPC, I will always prioritize whichever game seems to have the most potential to become great. For example, if tomorrow I get some random burst of inspiration which I feel would take Life of an NPC to the next level, I would redirect all my efforts in that direction. Currently, I am focusing on AI Roguelite (original). That may change in a few months, or it may not. This message was last updated July 2025.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3489080?t=1753295161","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3489080?t=1753295161","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489080/a40c67e7fa7ba47cbd834d35eeb9a27440c6be38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753295161","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489080/a40c67e7fa7ba47cbd834d35eeb9a27440c6be38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753295161","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life of an NPC is a top-down AI-directed town simulator. Each NPC formulates their own goals and decides how to respond to other NPCs or in-game events. They can also use items on each other or interact with objects within the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towns are procedurally generated via your prompt. Manipulate a character's goals or add new objects into the world to see how they react and develop over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is currently in Early Access. Please see the &quot;Early Access&quot; section for details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Notice</strong>: The future of this game is uncertain and continued updates are not guaranteed, though I will do my best to ensure it isn\u2019t broken. Among AI Roguelite, AI Roguelite 2D, and Life of an NPC, I will always prioritize whichever game seems to have the most potential to become great. For example, if tomorrow I get some random burst of inspiration which I feel would take Life of an NPC to the next level, I would redirect all my efforts in that direction. Currently, I am focusing on AI Roguelite (original). That may change in a few months, or it may not. This message was last updated July 2025.</p>","developers":["Max Loh"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489080/header.jpg?t=1753295161","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3489080/825306/c76f70a212dc5e9b144a8ed295edaaebf740f8ab/17